WEBVTT

00:02:32.192 --> 00:03:02.809
★Didn’t you say that you used to live in China, Joan?
☆Yeah. I lived there for several years. Why?
★Well, my friend went there on vacation recently, and he sent me this postcard. The writing on the front is Chinese. Can you read it?
☆Sorry, Dan. I speak Chinese pretty well, but I never learned how to read it.
☆☆Question: What does the woman say?
